  "body": "Discover this charming, single-level residence on Cape Cod Drive. Perfectly designed for retirees or couples seeking a peaceful, low-maintenance lifestyle, this home is nestled in the heart of the vibrant Gulf Harbour community.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the freedom of a \"lock-up-and-leave\" lifestyle just moments from local shops, eateries, and scenic coastal walks. Convenient transport links, including the ferry to Auckland CBD and buses, make for convenient and stress-free connections.\r\n\r\nBuild in 2014 by Universal Homes, this quality weatherboard home is move-in ready and designed for ease of use.  Light-filled, open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows seamlessly onto a sunny, sheltered, and private outdoor patio with a perfect North-facing aspect, ideal for entertaining.  Well maintained manicured gardens offers low maintenance for your outdoor enjoyment.\r\n\r\nFeaturing two generous bedrooms, a well-appointed bathroom, and a single-car garage provides secure parking and additional storage, with extra space for a camper out the front for your travel adventures.\r\n\r\nThis home will be sold so get in contact with us to view.",
